_1-.jpg/500px-Modell_einer_Peanoschen_Fl%C3%A4che_-Schilling_XLIX%2C_1-.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Modell_einer_Peanoschen_Fl%C3%A4che_-Schilling_XLIX%2C_1-.jpg/500px-Modell_einer_Peanoschen_Fl%C3%A4che_-Schilling_XLIX%2C_1-.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Peano surface, a counterexample to some criteria of local maxima of the 19th century","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AModell_einer_Peanoschen_Fl%C3%A4che_-Schilling_XLIX%2C_1-.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/MaximumParaboloid.png/500px-MaximumParaboloid.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/MaximumParaboloid.png/500px-MaximumParaboloid.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The global maximum is the point at the top","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMaximumParaboloid.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/MaximumCounterexample.png/500px-MaximumCounterexample.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/MaximumCounterexample.png/500px-MaximumCounterexample.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Counterexample: The red dot shows a local minimum that is not a global minimum","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMaximumCounterexample.png"}],"sounds":{"maximum":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/En-uk-maximum.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ad/En-uk-maximum.ogg/En-uk-maximum.og